# New/untracked skill dirs only (already-tracked ones like github, render-deploy,
# sentry-python-sdk, supabase-postgres-best-practices, vercel-deploy are unaffected --
# gitignore doesn't untrack files already in git). Keeps third-party marketplace
# skills (design/, ui-ux-pro-max/, etc.) from being committed by accident.
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/github/
!.claude/skills/render-deploy/
!.claude/skills/sentry-python-sdk/
!.claude/skills/supabase-postgres-best-practices/
!.claude/skills/vercel-deploy/
